title: NPR Conference
subtitle: The NPR chooses their stance about Lanckorona...
view-if: lanckorona_pact == 1
on-arrival: npr_leader = 'Vacant'
max-visits: 1
tags: event
new-page: true
face-image: img/npr.webp

= NPR Conference

The PSL-P and ZLN has made a pact strengthening their political alliance dubbed as the "Lanckorona Pact", since the PSL-P was a close partner to the NPR, Now, the party holds a conference to decide their stance on the pact.

During the conference, Jankowski, steps down as party chairman to assume the vice-chair position, the conference will now also elect a new leader.

- @no_lanckorona: The party elects rejects the Chjeno-Piast.
- @indecisive: The party remains indecisive in their stance.
- @yes_lanckorona: The party supports the Chjeno-Piast.

@yes_lanckorona
on-arrival: npr_leader = "Wachowiak"; npr_relation -= 15
face-image: img/portraits/WachowiakStanisław.jpg

Stanisław Wachowiak, a conservative and Christian democratic figure in the party has been selected as the chairman of the NPR. He seems to represent a rightward turn from Jankowski, and will be more aligned with the ZLN.

@indecisive
unavailable-subtitle: Our relations are not good enough.
subtitle: Joos is likely to be friendlier to us than Kaas.
on-arrival: z_party_leader = "Joos"; catholics_spd += 5; workers_z += 3
face-image: img/portraits/NPR_1923_Leader.png

With our grassroots connections, we have been able to influence the Center delegates to support Joseph Joos as the new Center chairman. He has long been a friend of the SPD, and will be more inclined to collaborate with us compared to Kaas. He also increases the appeal of the Center Party to the working class.

@no_lanckorona
on-arrival: resources -= 1; z_party_leader = "Joos"; catholics_spd += 5; workers_z += 3
face-image: img/portraits/NPR_1923_Leader.png

With our grassroots connections as well as a professional campaign, we have been able to influence the Center delegates to support Joseph Joos as the new Center chairman. He has long been a friend of the SPD, and will be more inclined to collaborate with us compared to Kaas. He also increases the appeal of the Center Party to the working class.
